Modifications in this fork include:
- the visible name Hearthvault
- a shared cell query for walls, holes, and open floors
- an entity-type registry used by save/load and the editor
- a generated WebAudio soundtrack (footsteps, mechanisms, ambient beds)
- a static build served from the /crawl/ subpath

DelveWard's sprites, levels, and code are part of the upstream work
and remain under EUPL-1.2. Hearthvault adds no assets from Dungeon
Master, Eye of the Beholder, Might and Magic, or any other commercial
game. Sounds in this fork are synthesized in the browser.
